    Fix Entwine Dependency Error (#6836)
    
    Merging pull request #6689 caused the maven dependency plugin to
    complain about the entwine functional library being declared as being
    used, but never actually being used in the scheduler module. This patch
    fixes the problem, un-breaking the `develop` branch.
    
